<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Nagelfluhkette: Hochgrat–Mittag Ridge Traverse — Hochgratbahn–Hochgrat–Rindalphorn–Mittagbahn complete ridge traverse</name><desc>Follow the complete official west-to-east ridge itinerary from Hochgratbahn upper station to Mittagbahn upper station, retaining the Rindalphorn summit approach and return and the Steineberg ladder. This is an exposed mountain route for experienced hikers in stable, snow-free conditions.

